            "id": "4957209",
            "title": "Forterra: Brick By Brick Through The Bottom Of The Cycle",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"English new-build houses\" data-id=\"2294748694\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1056\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2294748694/image_2294748694.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">georgeclerk/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h2>Investment Thesis</h2> <p>It’s hard to get through a day anymore without hearing some version of: “There’s no company that isn’t facing disruption from AI”. These pundits seem not to have studied Forterra (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FTTRF\" title=\"Forterra plc\">FTTRF</a></span>)– the</p></body></html>",
